    `I did not pay within 28 days after the demand` IS TRUE
    `the retailer asked in writing for a deposit as security` IS FALSE
    `I did not give the deposit within 7 days after the request` IS FALSE
    `it is my relevant gas retailer, or has the right by assignment` IS TRUE
    `days of notice of its intention to cut off my supply` IS 7
    `the amount is genuinely in dispute` IS FALSE

`my disputed bill` MEANS `My unpaid bill` WITH
    `the retailer demanded payment in writing` IS TRUE
    `I did not pay within 28 days after the demand` IS TRUE
    `the retailer asked in writing for a deposit as security` IS FALSE
    `I did not give the deposit within 7 days after the request` IS FALSE
    `it is my relevant gas retailer, or has the right by assignment` IS TRUE
    `days of notice of its intention to cut off my supply` IS 7
    `the amount is genuinely in dispute` IS TRUE

`my bill unpaid, only 6 days' notice` MEANS `My unpaid bill` WITH
    `the retailer demanded payment in writing` IS TRUE
    `I did not pay within 28 days after the demand` IS TRUE
    `the retailer asked in writing for a deposit as security` IS FALSE
